{"bangumi":{"date":"2017-02-18","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/6a/98/191056_l1Cl1.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/6a/98/191056_l1Cl1.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/6a/98/191056_l1Cl1.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/6a/98/191056_l1Cl1.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/6a/98/191056_l1Cl1.jpg"},"summary":"那个国家中栖息着龙——\r\n神话中说，古时的人与龙定下了契约，龙帮助人，人帮助龙……\r\n舞台是“龙之国”。\r\n主人公是为国之守护神“龙”清理蛀牙菌的新手牙医——野野子。\r\n与邻国的战争日趋激烈，某天她在龙的牙上发现了昏倒的敌国少年兵。\r\n少年的名字是贝尔。\r\n他在被称作巨大灾难前会出现的不可思议现象中，于巨大的牙齿中复活了。\r\n贝尔对自己的处境感到茫然。为了鼓励他，野野子将他接纳为龙的牙医。\r\n虽然被卷入了激烈的战争，两人不久将去接受自己的命运……\r\n这是一场前所未有的雄壮、奇幻冒险！","name":"龍の歯医者","name_cn":"龙的牙医","tags":[{"name":"Khara","count":885,"total_count":8413},{"name":"原创","count":845,"total_count":622569},{"name":"鶴巻和哉","count":528,"total_count":1460},{"name":"OVA","count":525,"total_count":366203},{"name":"庵野秀明","count":523,"total_count":36915},{"name":"奇幻","count":453,"total_count":474106},{"name":"2017","count":440,"total_count":71606},{"name":"2017年2月","count":305,"total_count":900},{"name":"TV","count":269,"total_count":1409103},{"name":"舞城王太郎","count":199,"total_count":1016},{"name":"剧场版","count":179,"total_count":726869},{"name":"鹤卷和哉","count":155,"total_count":4539},{"name":"榎户洋司","count":132,"total_count":852},{"name":"NHK","count":58,"total_count":2323},{"name":"日本","count":52,"total_count":299530},{"name":"战斗","count":37,"total_count":474121},{"name":"TVSP","count":36,"total_count":1974},{"name":"2017年","count":31,"total_count":4380},{"name":"战争","count":27,"total_count":21709},{"name":"2017年1月","count":14,"total_count":23442},{"name":"榎戸洋司","count":12,"total_count":667},{"name":"吉浦康裕","count":10,"total_count":3367},{"name":"治愈","count":9,"total_count":302858},{"name":"林原惠美","count":7,"total_count":674},{"name":"龙的牙医","count":7,"total_count":7},{"name":"林原惠","count":7,"total_count":2709},{"name":"10年代","count":5,"total_count":2168},{"name":"日本动画","count